{"version":1,"content":"<p>【2029 😓】外媒報導，NVIDIA 次世代 Rubin 架構的「60 級別」主流顯示卡 GeForce RTX 6060 可能將延遲至 2029 年才會正式問世，發佈時程將比高階型號再推遲數個月。</p><p>該爆料同時指出，這款鎖定普及市場的主流顯示卡，其運算效能很可能會低於搭載 AMD RDNA 5 架構 SoC 的次世代家用主機 PlayStation 6。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T02:59:46.262312+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T02:49:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T09:37:42.838002+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T02:57:43.427726+00:00","content_hash":"9cb11ae4c05b65cbc475eb0f3e560f7c99477a6864d68bad120403724ce1c901","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}